@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Read hierarchy, filtered list, or detail
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "Work pages / WorkHierarchyBranch, WorkListView, or WorkItemDetailView" as page
  participant "IWorkItemService / WorkItemService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "WorkItemsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "GetWorkItemsQueryHandler / GetWorkItemQueryHandler" as handler
  participant "WorkItem" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Open the outline, expand a parent, load more, filter the list, or open an item
opt Collapse a branch
  actor -> page : Collapse
  page -> page : The branch's WorkHierarchyBranch is destroyed: loaded descendants released, any read in flight cancelled; focus stays on the toggle
end
page -> page : The view or branch sets its resource's query signal (expand, next batch of 25, filters, or item), or a change of its refresh input rereads its loaded resources; status loading shows the skeleton (the root branch's on the outline); already loaded rows stay
page -> client : workItemsResource (GetWorkItemsQuery: parent, type/status filters, search, page, page size; the outline's root branch sends type Initiative with no parent, and the work list sends no parent, so All types lists every item) or workItemResource (GetWorkItemQuery) reads for this consumer; a changed query aborts the superseded request
client -> access : GET /api/workspaces/{id}/work-items[/{itemId}]
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client --> page : sessionInterceptor calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once for this generation; the read is cancelled; sign in returns to the requested route
else Authenticated (every role may read work)
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send GetWorkItemsQuery or GetWorkItemQuery through MediatR 12.5.0
  note right of ctrl : Workspace and item IDs are path IDs with a {id:guid} route constraint; a malformed one matches no route and returns 404 without a category before any handler runs
  validation -> validation : L2-045 page of 1 or more, page size 1-100 (default 25); known type and status filters
  alt Invalid page, page size, or filter (for example a hand-edited work-list route)
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing read
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Work list: the field message with Clear filter; no Try again and no reference ID (filter-invalid state)
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle the validated query
    handler -> db : L2-045 read one bounded batch of summaries (no descriptions) in outline order (initiative, epic, story, and task positions, then ID; within one parent's batch that is sibling position, then ID), with parent title, assignee name and active flag, story estimate, child and done-child counts, open sprint, the full matching count, and, for one unfiltered sibling set (a parent's children, or type Initiative with no parent), its sibling-order version in one statement; or one item's detail with its sibling position, sibling count, and sibling-order version
    db --> handler : Bounded rows, full matching count, and order version (null unless the page is one sibling set with no status or search filter), or the detail
    alt Workspace not found (any work read, also after the project was deleted while the page was open)
      handler --> ctrl : 404; a detail read carries category workspace-not-found (the workspace is looked up before the item)
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
      client --> page : The view shows the project's not-found presentation ("Project not found", Back to projects; no Try again or reference ID; focus its heading when the replaced content held focus) and emits notFound; on the first one only the page calls the layout's refresh(), so the header rereads once and keeps only the breadcrumb
    else Item not found (detail read only): category item-not-found, or a 404 without a category (a malformed workspace or item ID the route constraint rejected)
      handler --> ctrl : 404 item-not-found (the route constraint's 404 carries no category and reaches no handler)
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
      client --> page : WorkItemDetailView's own not-found state offering the project's work and the project list, naming nothing the read didn't return; the layout's own header read decides separately whether the project exists (it still shows the project, or only the breadcrumb). A parentId that names no item is a filter that matches nothing: an empty page, never 404
    else Rows read
      handler -> entity : L2-029 resolve ancestor path and label unset optional fields
      entity --> handler : WorkItemSummary rows, or WorkItemDetail with workspace name, ancestor links, current assignee (ID, display name, active flag), open sprint (a task's from its story), and child and done-child counts
      handler --> ctrl : WorkItemPage (items, total count, page, page size, order version) or WorkItemDetail
      ctrl --> client : 200
      client --> page : The consumer's resource value resolves; only that view's signals change (a branch appends the batch and builds each row's WorkItemTarget, with a story's scopeSummary; the root branch shows the empty state, whose Add initiative emits addRequested, when the workspace has no initiatives); render titles as text
      page --> actor : Present results; after Load more announce "N more loaded" with focus kept on Load more, or, when the last batch arrived and Load more went away, on the first new row; after navigation move focus to the destination heading (the item heading on a detail)
    end
  end
end
opt Read fails unexpectedly (500 or 503 with correlation ID, or no response)
  client --> page : First load: error state with Try again (on the outline, the root WorkHierarchyBranch's, relayed by WorkHierarchyView), which emits retryRequested so the page calls the layout's refresh() and a failed project header rereads with the tab; next batch: keep loaded rows, the alert with Retry replaces Load more and receives focus (batch-error state); list: keep filters; each shows the reference ID only when the server answered
end
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Counts come from persisted records, never from loaded rows.
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
